                <li>All information furnished in this dealer registration application and the supporting documents submitted are true, correct, and complete to the best of our knowledge and belief.</li>
                <li>We authorise SPIC to verify the authenticity of all documents, information, and signatures provided herein through any means deemed appropriate.</li>
                <li>We understand that any misrepresentation, falsification, or concealment of material facts may result in immediate cancellation of the dealership, forfeiture of any deposits or guarantees, and may attract legal proceedings.</li>
                <li>We agree to abide by the terms and conditions, policies, and guidelines of SPIC as amended from time to time.</li>
                <li>We consent to SPIC collecting, processing, and storing our personal data and business information for the purpose of dealer registration and ongoing business operations in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
