    <div class='consent-section'>
        <div class='consent-title'>Declaration &amp; Consent</div>
        <div class='consent-text'>
            <p>I/We, the undersigned Partner(s)/Proprietor(s) of <strong>{firmName}</strong>, do hereby solemnly declare and affirm the following:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>The specimen signatures provided above are our genuine and authentic signatures, which shall be used for all official correspondence, agreements, and transactions with Greenstar Fertilizers Limited (GFL).</li>
                <li>All information furnished in this dealer registration application and the supporting documents submitted are true, correct, and complete to the best of our knowledge and belief.</li>
                <li>We authorise GFL to verify the authenticity of all documents, information, and signatures provided herein through any means deemed appropriate.</li>
                <li>We understand that any misrepresentation, falsification, or concealment of material facts may result in immediate cancellation of the dealership, forfeiture of any deposits or guarantees, and may attract legal proceedings.</li>
                <li>We agree to abide by the terms and conditions, policies, and guidelines of GFL as amended from time to time.</li>
                <li>We consent to GFL collecting, processing, and storing our personal data and business information for the purpose of dealer registration and ongoing business operations in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</li>
